    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.08_kg_cross_reference.concrete_anchor#validationreport" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor#validationreport silm:hasLongDescription "The ValidationReport is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{ValidationReport}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
