silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor#nodeorarrowlaw silm:hasLongDescription "The NodeOrArrowLaw is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{NodeOrArrowLaw} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor#musickgprofile a owl:NamedIndividual ;
