silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_08_kg_cross_reference_concrete_anchor#musickgprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicKGProfile is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{MusicKGProfile}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
